<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:35.570 --> 00:01:38.130
Try rewriting that data.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:41.290
Can't you restart the machine using this command?

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:42.440
Restart...

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:43.540
C'mon!

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:48.640
It's no good. The system is completely locked.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:51.010
Chris's security is impressive.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.540
We can't gain access at all.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.390
He was always good at that.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:58.070
How frustrating! How dare he leave us behind!

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:01.890
Not only did he leave on his own, but he hasn't contacted us since.

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:11.580
I wonder how everyone is doing?

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.560
I'm sure they're having a fun time.

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:16.010
Yeah.

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:30.560
Chris...

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:53.300
We're not finding any Chaos Emeralds.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:56.020
Chris, are you sure this device isn't broken?

00:02:56.020 --> 00:03:00.100
It's working fine. There's just too much static to search effectively.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.410
Static?

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:07.390
There are many locations in this galaxy with space and gravitational anomalies.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:15.180
Is it the Metarex's fault?

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:21.140
I don't know, but with this many abnormalities, it may affect other galaxies.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:26.870
Does that mean the abnormalities in the Metarex's galaxy might spread to our galaxy?

00:03:26.870 --> 00:03:28.340
I don't like that!

00:03:28.340 --> 00:03:30.170
Amy, the alarm!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:32.080
Metarex are nothing but trouble!

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.970
I'm detecting a Chaos Emerald!

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:40.930
Tails!

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:43.740
Roger. I'm changing our heading.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.280
An unidentified object is approaching!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.260
A meteor?

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.090
The Chaos Emerald is inside!

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:55.890
Okay, then...

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.750
I think I heard voices...

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:11.280
The meteor is moving!

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.870
That's not a meteor! It's a spaceship!

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:16.660
Wow!

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:22.340
Episode 69

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:22.340
Please, Marmolim!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:24.940
That was scary!

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:28.380
I was worried that we would be crushed to death.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.490
I'm sorry. We didn't think there was anyone on-board.

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:37.380
That was mean of you to mistake our super magical hyper spaceship for a meteor!

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:41.550
Do you live on a nearby planet?

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:46.290
Yes, we're Marmolims from Planet Marmolim! I'm Captain Lue!

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:48.320
I'm Lylem the navigator!

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.630
I'm Momo the chief engineer!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:58.760
We're on a very important mission!

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:05.620
Our planet is sick because its Planet Egg was stolen.

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:12.060
I see...

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:20.380
Our leader's fortunetelling informed us that there's someone in the galaxy who can heal our planet.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:24.980
But no matter where we look, we can't find that person.

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:26.800
And our spaceship broke.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.620
We're really depressed!

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.560
Please don't cry!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.690
You're right.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:35.910
Crying won't get us anywhere.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:39.590
We'll do fortunetelling to find out what to do next.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:44.190
They're weird.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:45.120
Yeah...

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:49.950
We detected a Chaos Emerald on your ship. Does that ring a bell?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.890
Chaos Emerald?

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:56.340
It's a beautiful gem about this size. It emits a strange glow.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.460
You mean this?

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:04.150
It's the Chaos Emerald!

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:05.720
They really did have one!

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:06.990
Thank you!

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.590
Huh?

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.140
I never said I was giving it to you.

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:17.410
We randomly found this during our journey.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:20.040
Since we found it, it's ours.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.640
You must be kidding! Give it back!

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:24.780
He's going to kill us!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:28.950
A violent thug is going to steal our treasure!

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:31.380
How dare you insult me!

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:32.190
Calm down.

00:06:32.190 --> 00:06:34.270
Stop acting childish, Knuckles.

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:35.980
Please calm down.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.210
You always resort to violence.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:40.780
So I'm the bad guy?

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:45.120
That object is very important. We've traveled throughout the galaxy to find it.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:48.080
You were looking for it? You're just like us.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.620
We've also had a long and tough journey.

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:52.680
Will you give it back to us?

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:55.190
Nope!

00:06:56.450 --> 00:07:00.290
Just looking at this gem give us comfort.

00:07:00.290 --> 00:07:01.910
We're taking it as a souvenir!

00:07:01.910 --> 00:07:04.450
Fate brought us together!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.140
This isn't good.

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:17.940
Why do we have to take them home?

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:22.280
They said that they'll give us the Chaos Emerald if we do.

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:27.050
Planet Marmolim is famous for fortunetelling. We'll also read your fortune.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:30.230
Work, health, money, love...

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:32.140
Love?

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:34.860
That's our specialty!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:40.590
Chris! Tails! We're leaving for Planet Marmolim immediately!

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.240
Roger...

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:03.540
Welcome back! We're glad that you're okay!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.560
We're sorry that we made you worry.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.790
I guess I'll give this back.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.090
Of course.

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:10.890
I'm glad that's settled.

00:08:10.890 --> 00:08:13.750
So where's the matchmaking hut?

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.110
This way!

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:17.110
Okay! Let's go, Sonic!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.220
Hey hey, Amy!

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:23.150
Amy?

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.150
She's hopeless.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:29.550
Their readings are right on the mark, so you should listen closely, Sonic!

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:31.980
How compatible are we?

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:46.420
It's really bustling.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.630
Marmolim is the planet for fortunetelling and matchmaking.

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:53.480
Before the Metarex arrived, customers came from all over the galaxy.

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.590
Maybe I'll buy something.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:08:59.960
This is a charm store specializing in curing illnesses.

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:04.820
They have charms for curing coughs, headaches, crying at night, corns and athlete's foot!

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:06.700
Chris, you have athlete's foot?

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:08.000
No!

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.860
Fortunetelling...

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:16.340
This is the first time I'll have my fortune told!

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:18.820
She'll also teach you a good luck charm.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:22.760
Really? What fortune do we want to know, Cheese?

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:28.000
The planet is sick, but everyone is easygoing.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.040
Lue!

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.490
Ghana!

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:47.560
I see. You couldn't find anyone who could heal our planet.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.150
I'm very sorry.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:53.050
Brooding isn't going to help. I'm sure it will work out.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.570
You're right! We'll keep trying!

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.620
Are you really fine with that?

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.250
No one can stop the flow of destiny.

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:06.680
We use fortunetelling to inquire what might happen.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.100
But...

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.590
You must not get impatient.

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:16.690
The coins are telling me that your impatience will lead others into trouble.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.440
Cosmo!

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:29.890
Ghana...

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:38.250
How unusual. It's the first time I've seen someone from a plant species together with people from an animal species.

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:45.450
Cosmo, wait!

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:47.480
Don't let it bother you.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:51.410
Fortunetelling is nothing more than probabilities.

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:54.070
I'm in the same situation as the people on this planet.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:59.080
I have no power and can't do anything, but I'm impatient and angry.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:01.510
Cosmo...

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.190
I'm sorry!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.830
This is Lovers' Rock.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:37.920
How wonderful!

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:41.840
If two people break this rock together, they will be together forever.

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:43.090
Forever?

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.970
What shall I do, Sonic?

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:50.560
Let's go! For our eternal love!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.980
Ready?

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:53.600
Now's my chance!

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:54.940
Sonic?

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:59.490
Can you see anything?

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:04.410
You're worried that since you're too honest, you're easily deceived.

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:09.410
How did you know? How can I avoid being deceived?

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:10.910
Leave it to me.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:15.130
First, use this magic towel and rub yourself down every morning.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.590
I'll buy it!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:21.220
Isn't he being deceived again?

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.760
Those who believe will be saved.

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.930
Sonic?

00:12:30.930 --> 00:12:32.940
Sonic!

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:41.690
I won't let you get away! We're going to Lovers' Lake, Lovers' Mountain and Matchmaking Shrine!

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:48.030
I don't think it's a good idea to force him.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:51.540
Is there someone you want to match up with?

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:55.250
Me? Well, it's not that I don't, but...

00:12:55.710 --> 00:13:00.000
I can tell that you have a girlfriend! I'm jealous!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.460
Cut it out!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.720
Chris!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.510
Cream and Tails?

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:08.180
Where's Cosmo?

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:25.030
There are so many things that I want to protect, such as my friends and this galaxy.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.620
But I'm small and can't do anything.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:44.380
This planet's sun changes color at a certain time.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.220
Cheese.

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:03.190
Ghana said that there are many planets in the universe.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:08.740
However, there are barely any planets where plants and animals live together in peace.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.780
That's true for the planets we visited so far.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:17.500
There were only plants on plant planets.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:21.170
And there were only animals on animal planets.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:26.300
But we've become friends with you, Cosmo.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:29.430
Cream! Cheese!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.760
Sonic!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:36.060
Doesn't this prove that he doesn't have feelings for you?

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:37.190
You're wrong!

00:14:37.190 --> 00:14:41.190
No matter what he says, he always rescues me when I'm trouble.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:48.150
And when he came back from Chris's world, he picked a flower, gave it to me and said:

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.530
"Oh, Amy..."

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:50.490
Amy!

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:54.540
Did you have your fortune read?

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:55.700
No, not yet.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.580
What have you been doing? I'll take you there!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.720
I have a result!

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.720
You will have excellent luck!

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:19.310
Cosmo, how do you feel about Tails?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.810
Tails?

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:25.940
I feel there's something going on between you two. So?

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.320
Well...

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.860
You caught me off-guard.

00:15:29.860 --> 00:15:32.070
Just as I thought.

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:33.660
You have it all wrong!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:39.500
I'm always annoying Tails, and I also yelled at him a little while ago.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:43.040
I don't think Tails thinks you're annoying.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:47.670
Anyway, how's the matchmaking going between you and Sonic, Amy?

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:51.380
Amy?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:54.100
Did I say something that I shouldn't have?

00:15:55.810 --> 00:16:01.940
It's okay. Momo taught me a powerful Marmolim love spell!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:07.900
This time, Sonic will be mine!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:13.490
Tails?

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.830
I found the cause.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:27.210
This is the source of the planet's illness?

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:32.800
Since its Planet Egg was stolen, a section of the earth changed into something resembling cancer cells.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:38.680
If we remove this section, the planet should become healthy again.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:42.350
I guess it's my turn.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:46.610
Really?

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:51.320
Yeah! I'll destroy this planet's cancer cells with my Sonic Driver!

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.280
Our planet will be healed.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:55.160
Our fortunetelling was correct!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.120
We found the person who will cure our planet!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.240
Mission super accomplished!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:04.920
But there are hard bedrock and subterranean water next to the cancer cells.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.840
We need your help to carry out the plan.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.460
This is a lucky charm!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.090
Take it with you!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.380
Try your best!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:13.800
I'll pray for you!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.840
Wait!

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.240
You're not going to wear them?

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:44.160
I'll just accept their well-wishes. I believe in my own strength.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:45.250
You're right.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:49.920
When we destroy the cancer cells, the surrounding subterranean water will flow in.

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:53.420
We'll come rescue you right away, so hang on for a while.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.260
Water? Are you serious?

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:56.680
Where is it?

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.340
This charm wards off water disasters.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.100
Perfect!

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:10.230
Connecting energy to the cannon's hammer!

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.440
Pressurizing the cannon rod's ring energy!

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.490
Typhoon lifting off!

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.040
Adjusting the angle of the main cannon.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.890
Sonic, start your spin!

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.060
Okay!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:51.310
Fire Sonic Driver!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:38.070
He did it!

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:57.670
It's a great success!

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:59.340
That's why he's Sonic!

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.430
Hooray!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:05.390
Damn! This charm doesn't work at all!

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:08.850
Chris! Tails!

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:22.160
What's wrong? What are you doing here?

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:29.160
Tails, I heard that you were the one who figured out how to cure this planet.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:33.170
We only succeeded because everyone helped out.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:35.170
That includes you, of course.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.380
No, I didn't do anything.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.960
Hey, Cosmo.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:43.090
Don't keep your worries bottled up.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.640
You can talk to me about anything.

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:47.430
Or am I not good enough?

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:50.520
Huh? No!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.190
You're not!

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:56.400
Wait! I mean you're not not good enough!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:01.490
That's all I wanted to say because I didn't get a chance last time.

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.900
Wait up!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.430
Are you all right?

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:30.520
Yes. What was that?

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:39.360
A matchmaking spell?

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.650
A very strong one.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:48.740
If a couple soaks themselves in water the moment the sky turns blue, they will be together forever!

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:52.580
That means it will work out perfectly for Amy and Sonic!

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:54.040
Of course!

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:59.210
Amy was excited to create a trap that Sonic couldn't escape!

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:04.380
That means Sonic and Amy are now...

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.180
Thanks.

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:09.800
Huh?

00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:12.430
What?

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:27.740
Why were they caught in the love trap that I set for Sonic?

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:29.450
My plan is ruined!

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:33.290
I hate Sonic!

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:37.750
I mean the opposite! I love you!

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:42.840
Sonic, you idiot!

